sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Agent as LLM Agent / Host
    participant Client as MCP Client
    participant Server as MCP Server
    participant Tool as Tools / Data Sources

    User->>Agent: Send task / prompt

    Agent->>Agent: Build context and decide whether<br/>external capability is needed

    Agent->>Client: Request tool/resource via MCP

    Client->>Server: MCP request<br/>(JSON-RPC 2.0)

    Server->>Tool: Execute tool / query data source
    Tool-->>Server: Return result / data

    Server-->>Client: MCP response

    Client-->>Agent: Return structured result

    Agent->>Agent: Add result to context<br/>and continue reasoning

    Agent-->>User: Final response
